  step "hPanel → each website → SSL: active on www.$DOMAIN and admin.$DOMAIN."
  step "Redirect $DOMAIN to https://www.$DOMAIN (www is canonical)."
  warn "Once HTTPS works the apps send HSTS — never point these hosts back at plain HTTP."
  step "Re-check: Supabase Site/Redirect URLs (stages 11–12), the Razorpay live webhook (13), Resend shows Verified."
